---
// Safety-critical system chrome, not editorial content: a deliberate,
// commented exception to "rust never as a large fill" (see CLAUDE.md). This
// bar has to be impossible to miss, which is the opposite of what "resting"
// accent styling is for.
//
// data-draft-banner is a stable marker: scripts/assert-no-draft-leak.mjs
// greps the production build output for it and fails the build if it's
// ever found there.
---

<div
  data-draft-banner
  class="bg-accent text-label text-inverse-text fixed inset-x-0 top-0 z-[60] flex h-(--draft-banner-height) items-center justify-center px-4 text-center font-mono uppercase"
>
  This is an unpublished draft, not visible on the live site
</div>
